TVP — code framework
====================

This repository contains modified code from TF-VPR:

    TF-VPR: A Novel Benchmark for Training-Free Visual Place Recognition
    Copyright (c) 2024 Feng Lu
    MIT License (see LICENSE)

Modifications (2026):

  * model/network_infer.py
      - multi-scale GeM view (13 cells) and global mean view (1 token) in
        addition to the 17-token TF-CAM semantic view;
      - single-forward-pass TF + VLAD aggregation (`--mode TF_VLAD`,
        `--vlad_centers2` for a second codebook);
      - per-block output layout used by the offline calibration tools.
  * model/free_module.py
      - frozen-backbone helper extended for the multi-view forward pass.
  * model/ot_cam.py, model/lang_prompt.py
      - optional OT token purification and CLIP language-prompt experiments
        (reported as neutral/negative in the accompanying notes).
  * eval.py, parser.py, datasets_ws.py, test.py
      - new modes/options, per-view descriptor dumps, indoor radii handling.
  * run_eval.sh
      - wrapper with portable paths and environment defaults.

The scripts under tools/ were written for this project and are distributed
under the same MIT license.

No datasets, pretrained weights, feature dumps or experimental results are
included in this repository.
